  "label": "User projected onto the scene of blackhead extraction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual scene of the woman extracting a blackhead, as the meme implies that the viewer (user) is being shown 'the proper way' to perform this action. This projection is implicit, not explicit, and is established through the instructional tone of the text and the visual focus on the action. The user is invited to imagine themselves performing the action or to identify with the depicted method.",
